<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM Q2 revenues and costs in detail.</title>
<headline>KLM Q2 revenues and costs in detail.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second qtr 1996/97 to Sept 30.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>OPERATING REVENUES</p>
<p>    KLM passenger traffic (billions)    1.86  vs  1.72</p>
<p>    KLM cargo traffic			  420  vs   409</p>
<p>Traffic revenues of other</p>
<p>    consolidated companies		   192  vs   184</p>
<p>    Total traffic revenues (billions)   2.48  vs  2.31</p>
<p>    Other revenues			     346  vs   324</p>
<p>    Total operating revenues (billions) 2.82  vs  2.63</p>
<p>OPERATING COSTS</p>
<p>    Salaries/benefits			  741  vs   664</p>
<p>    Aircraft fuel				277  vs   218</p>
<p>    Materials/consumables		    162  vs   155</p>
<p>    Commercial costs			   270  vs   253</p>
<p>    Landing/navigation charges	     219  vs   201</p>
<p>    Third-party handling costs		95  vs    82</p>
<p>    Work by third parties		    185  vs   151</p>
<p>    Depreciations				224  vs   212</p>
<p>    Operational lease expenses		50  vs    17</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous				417  vs   347</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
